## The Gap: Retail → Institutional

| Dimension | Current (Retail) | Target (Quant/Institutional) |
|---|---|---|
| **Signal Source** | Technical indicators only (EMA, RSI, ADX, MACD) | Multi-source: Technicals + Sentiment + On-Chain + Order Flow |
| **Confidence** | Binary (signal or no signal) | Probabilistic (expected value after fees, win rate, risk/reward) |
| **Backtesting** | None (live-only validation) | Full regime simulation (Bull / Bear / Sideways / Mean Reversion) |
| **Risk** | Static % sizing + drawdown halt | Dynamic Kelly Criterion, correlation-aware, regime-adaptive |
| **Execution** | Market orders only | Limit orders, TWAP, slippage modeling |
| **ADX Filter** | Fixed threshold (30) | Data-driven optimal threshold per regime |

